# Research Workflow

The `agency/` folder is the project memory.

## Required Folders

```txt
agency/brief/
agency/audit/
agency/refs/
agency/specs/
agency/prompts/
agency/runbooks/
```

## Use The Folders This Way

- `brief/`: client inputs, positioning, constraints, image style guide.
- `audit/`: current-site findings, SEO notes, compliance notes, migration risks.
- `refs/`: reference site analysis, layout patterns, brand hacks.
- `specs/`: page-level and feature-level instructions before code.
- `prompts/`: reusable prompts for manual agent workflows.
- `runbooks/`: SOPs and checklists.

## Agent Output Rule

When using ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Cursor, or Codex for research or planning, save the useful output into one of these folders. Do not leave important decisions trapped in chat history.
